		{
			dependencies: ["4FCED0BCD5B7DCBE"]
			description: [
				"&6&n&lPROJECT MANAGER:&r&r&r"
				""
				"You may notice some piles of &brocks&r on the ground of your planet. These indicate where &6ores&r are below the ground. Picking some up will add the &evein&r your your map, accessable with '&dJ&r'. "
				""
				"Ore generates is a &cvery&r different way then you may expect. The next page should give you a &ebasic&r idea."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"On this planet, ore generates a &blarge&r, multichunk veins across the world. They are &6seperated&r into a &d3x3&r grid. This means that if a chunk contains &bore&r, 3 chunks in all cardinal directions will also have &bore&r veins. This is true for every planet and dimension. Chunks can also contain two veins, one typically &2higher&r up then its counter part. "
				""
				"If you happen to find ores below ground, &dmining&r one or right clicking will also add a vein to your &emap&r."
				"For more information on ore specifics, check &bthe ore generation&r tab. Vein info is viewable by &eclicking&r on an ore."
			]
